- Title.
- Material type.
- Extracted content.
- Content structure.
- Page or slide references.
- Created timestamp.
- Updated timestamp.
- Processing status.
- Optional student notes.

Large document handling

Do not allow document ingestion to become an uncontrolled process.

Implement sensible handling for:

- Large PDFs.
- Long documents.
- Processing timeouts.
- API limitations.
- Token limits.
- Extraction failures.
- Page-range selection where useful.
- Splitting documents into manageable segments.

The student should not be forced to manually screenshot every page of a document that can be processed automatically.

