7.3 FILL-IN-THE-GAP

Generate fill-in-the-gap exercises from course materials.

The AI should remove an important word, phrase, concept, or part of a sentence and ask the student to complete it.

Features

- Display the sentence with the missing portion.
- Allow typed answers.
- Submit answer.
- Evaluate answer.
- Accept reasonable synonyms or equivalent answers where appropriate.
- Show the correct answer.
- Explain the concept.
- Track correct and incorrect answers.
- Retry.
- Save exercises.
- Revisit later.

Avoid ambiguous gaps where several answers could reasonably be correct unless the evaluation explicitly accommodates them.

